./dist/jc72108-theory-bundle-v1/xmodel/sol-avenues2.md:156:The honest \(td=7\) book has 1,390 exact-budget routes out of 1,689. Those routes cannot absorb even one additional unit; the 299 slack routes can. This makes proof-level equality classification much sharper here than another budget recomposition. The latter has already been exhausted on the residue-A template (`TEMPLATE-ATTACK.md`); the proposed object is the equality case of every constituent ramification estimate on the repaired off-axis routes.
